642:- For the repeated Nov. 4 review runs, the user required a genuinely cold review, one pass only, bounded commands/assigned ports, no commits, and writes only in the named tool and `_scratch` folders -> treat those as hard scope/stop constraints and return exactly `Review done` after the report. [Task 13][Task 14][Task 15][Task 16][Task 17][Task 19][Task 20]
650:- When cold-reviewing, the user said “Play it before you read what the builder said,” “fix every blocker and should fix,” and “do not make it plainer” -> begin with unbiased hands-on play, preserve the tool’s strong visual/game qualities, make scoped repairs, write `codex-review.md`, and stop at `Review done` after the requested one/two passes. [Task 4][Task 7]
661:- Treat mechanical-audit leads as triage prompts, not defects: inspect frames, test intentional modal/scroll/first-tap behavior against the spec, and record dispositions. A completed audit can still be pre-fix if its iframe served an earlier bundle. [Task 13][Task 14][Task 15][Task 19]
679:- Symptom: full audit fails, times out, or runs before final fixes -> do not call full walk/repeat/resize coverage clean. `KeyError: End` stopped Water Shapes Earth after 64 frames with no `audit.md`; correct unsupported audit keys before the run, preserve targeted evidence, and state the coverage boundary. [Task 21]
680:- Symptom: an audit timed out, lost its resize connection, was deferred, or predates focused fixes -> retain its exact boundary. Act It Out had 73 frames/no `audit.md` plus untested resize-mid-animation; Design Challenge Studio's retry omitted the full control walk; Captain's Choices deferred the host/audit pass; Data Policy Council, Design for a Friend, Reserve Designer, Research Quest, Speech Coach, and Traffic Light Coder have pre-fix audit snapshots rather than final full certification. [Task 24]
683:- Symptom: audit report says `0 leads` or `Not finished` while the process is still running -> wait for completion and generated frames before calling coverage final. For targeted scripts, replace `%T%`/ `%KEEP%` placeholders with `.replace(...).strip()`. [Task 18][Task 19]
692:- Symptom: `audit_tool.py` hits its 30-minute limit or emits no `audit.md` -> this is unfinished full walk/repeat/resize coverage, not a clean audit. Preserve `AUDIT_TIMEOUT`, captured frames, and targeted evidence in the report; do not retry when the one-audit/one-pass contract forbids it. [Task 4][Task 7][Task 8]

