211: | g8-ml-evaluate: a model's features and limits from its test results and model card | 4 | g9-ai-tour; g9-det-vs-prob | AI algorithm types matched to tasks; deterministic against probabilistic |
212: | g8-modify-for-bias: a rule changed to remove a harm, retested on the same cases | 4 | g9-algorithm-impacts | A rule-based case audited |
213: | g8-ai-tool-day: a generated output judged against the problem, on the teacher's one screen | 4 | None | The generated-text thread goes on through g8-evaluate-ai-code |
214: | g8-evaluate-ai-code: saved generated samples judged for accuracy and usability, first wrong line named | 4 | g10-analyze-code | One saved sample read and traced among the analysis programs |
215: | g8-emerging-design; g8-emerging-debate: design decisions that change the experience for communities; a local debate with sources | 5 | g9-emerging-differences | An emerging technology set against the established one |
216: | g8-history-case: a history case reread for what a rule could have done | 5 | g9-computing-history | One technology's trajectory with its social and environmental factors |
217: | g8-career-sketch: one computing career path, its skills and how automation may change it | 5 | g9-career-interests | A goal, its computing skills and one next step, kept private |
