| Year 8: Layers of computing systems | 5 Thinking machines | Unit 6, session 60 | Read for order on what AI can and cannot do | Lessons 1 to 3 (hardware parts, inside the machine, the operating system): owned in grade 6 (MS-SYS-HW-30) and grade 9 (g9-operating-systems); lesson 4 (logic): no grade 7 id; lesson 6 (sharing, open source): offered to grade 8's g8-attribution |
