Units 3, 4 and 5, unit 2 sessions 14 to 23, and unit 6 except session 60 are our own: the partial base's Year 8 has
no unit on data visualization, personal data, machine learning, algorithmic bias, networks, security or the impacts
of computing as CSTA 2026 asks for them.
